{"seq":1,"slug":"xdp-l4-load-balancing","title":"XDP 负载均衡与 L4 转发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/linux-xdp-afxdp-ebpf-fast-datapath/fast-datapath-patterns/xdp-l4-load-balancing","wordCount":2497,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"xdp-负载均衡与-l4-转发\">XDP 负载均衡与 L4 转发</h1><p>一个 L4 负载均衡器在每台机器上每秒要处理的包数，通常比它背后的业务服务器高一个数量级：一台入口机把几万个后端连接压成一条几 Gbps 的入口流。把这条路径放在内核协议栈之后意味着每个包要走一次 <code>alloc_skb</code>、一次路由查找、一次 <code>netfilter</code> 链——在直连返回（Direct Server Return，DSR）模型下这些都是纯浪费，因为均衡器根本不需要终结 TCP。XDP 的价值恰在于它运行在 <code>sk_buff</code> 分配之前，配合 DSR 让均衡器只碰一下包头再反射回去。本文拆解这条转发路径上的四个工程决定：在哪一层选后端、用什么哈希把连接钉住、怎么在不终结连接的前提下改写包、以及如何把它接到 DDoS 清洗线上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-l4-均衡器的三种转发模型与其代价\">核心概念：L4 均衡器的三种转发模型与其代价</h2><p>L4 均衡器决定「把哪个新连接发给哪台后端」，但转发方式有三类，代价差别极大：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>代理模式（proxy / NAT）</strong>：均衡器终结 TCP，与后端再建一条连接。连接状态、窗口、拥塞控制全在均衡器上，回包也必须穿回均衡器。它最灵活（可做 TLS 卸载、七层策略），但带宽与连接数是硬上限。</li>\n<li><strong>DSR / 三角路由</strong>：请求包被转发给后端，后端<strong>直接</strong>把回应发给客户端，绕过均衡器。回包路径完全不占均衡器带宽，代价是后端必须配置 VIP（通常绑在 <code>lo</code> 上并关闭 ARP 响应），且均衡器无法看回包。</li>\n<li><strong>封装转发（IP-in-IP / GUE）</strong>：均衡器把原包塞进一个 IP 隧道（协议号 4，IP-in-IP，见 RFC 2003）发给后端，后端解封装后按内层包头回包。相比 DSR 的 MAC 层改写，封装跨三层，均衡器与后端可以不在同一网段，这是现代大规模部署的主流选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Facebook/Meta 开源的 <strong>Katran</strong> 就是这个模型的生产实现：XDP 程序读五元组、查一致性哈希表选后端、用 IP-in-IP 或 GUE 封装后从同网卡发回（<code>XDP_TX</code>）；回包不经它。项目源码见 <a href=\"https://github.com/facebookincubator/katran\">facebookincubator/katran</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    C[客户端 SYN] --&gt; NIC[入口网卡 RX 队列]&#10;    NIC --&gt; XDP{XDP 程序&lt;br/&gt;读五元组}&#10;    XDP --&gt;|新连接| H[一致性哈希&lt;br/&gt;选后端]&#10;    XDP --&gt;|已知连接| CT[(BPF 连接表&lt;br/&gt;LRU hash)]&#10;    H --&gt; CT&#10;    CT --&gt; ENC[IP-in-IP 封装&lt;br/&gt;外层 dst = 后端]&#10;    ENC --&gt; TX[XDP_TX 原路发出]&#10;    TX --&gt; B[后端解封装&lt;br/&gt;应用回包]&#10;    B --&gt;|DSR 直发| C&#10;    XDP --&gt;|DDoS 特征| DROP[XDP_DROP]\">flowchart TD\n    C[客户端 SYN] --&gt; NIC[入口网卡 RX 队列]\n    NIC --&gt; XDP{XDP 程序&lt;br/&gt;读五元组}\n    XDP --&gt;|新连接| H[一致性哈希&lt;br/&gt;选后端]\n    XDP --&gt;|已知连接| CT[(BPF 连接表&lt;br/&gt;LRU hash)]\n    H --&gt; CT\n    CT --&gt; ENC[IP-in-IP 封装&lt;br/&gt;外层 dst = 后端]\n    ENC --&gt; TX[XDP_TX 原路发出]\n    TX --&gt; B[后端解封装&lt;br/&gt;应用回包]\n    B --&gt;|DSR 直发| C\n    XDP --&gt;|DDoS 特征| DROP[XDP_DROP]</pre><p>关键的架构收益是<strong>状态极大简化</strong>：因为回包不走均衡器，BPF 里只需要维护「新连接 → 后端」的正向映射，不需要完整 conntrack，也不需要处理 TCP 三次握手的中间状态。Katran 的连接表用 <code>BPF_MAP_TYPE_LRU_HASH</code>，键是五元组，值是后端索引加封装参数；表满时 LRU 自动淘汰最久未用的表项——对一个只关心「这条流去哪」的均衡器，淘汰一条老流最多导致下一包按新哈希重选后端，而这在长连接上几乎不会发生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"maglev-哈希-为什么不能直接用五元组取模\">Maglev 哈希：为什么不能直接用五元组取模</h2><p>最朴素的后端选择是 <code>hash(五元组) % N</code>。它的致命问题在<strong>后端数量变化</strong>时暴露：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 从 100 变成 101，几乎所有键的取模结果都变了，连接大面积重映射到新后端，后面所有服务的缓存全部失效。一致性哈希解决这个问题，而 Google 在 NSDI 2016 发表的 <strong>Maglev</strong> 论文给出了一个在生产规模上验证过的具体算法（<a href=\"https://www.usenix.org/conference/nsdi16/technical-sessions/presentation/eisenbud\">Eisenbud et al., NSDI&#39;16</a>）。</p>\n<p>Maglev 的核心是一个长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>查找表</strong>（论文实现取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>65537</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = 65537</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">65537</span></span></span></span></span>，一个质数），表项是后端索引。每个后端用两个哈希 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_1, h_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 生成一条伪随机的<strong>置换序列</strong>（permutation），把候选槽位按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>…</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">offset, offset+skip, offset+2 \\cdot skip \\dots</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span></span></span></span></span> 的顺序依次列出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>name</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>M</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>skip</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>name</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset} = h_1(\\text{name}) \\bmod M, \\quad\n\\text{skip} = h_2(\\text{name}) \\bmod (M-1) + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">name</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">skip</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">name</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>构建时轮询每个后端的置换序列，把尚未被占用的槽位填上自己，直到所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 个槽都被填满。查表时只做一次哈希 <code>hash(五元组) % M</code> 取槽，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，且这张表本身可以放进 BPF map 或直接编进程序常量。后端增删时只有被移除后端原本占据的槽位需要重填，其余槽位不动——这正是「最小扰动」的工程含义。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选后端算法</th>\n<th>查表复杂度</th>\n<th>后端增删时的连接扰动</th>\n<th>BPF 可实现性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>随机 / round-robin</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无（但无法保证同流同后端）</td>\n<td>需额外连接表补一致性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>五元组取模 <code>% N</code></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极大，近似全量重映射</td>\n<td>简单但不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性哈希环</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅相邻区间移动</td>\n<td>需查环，BPF 内较笨重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Maglev 查找表</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅被增删后端所占槽位</td>\n<td>一张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 项数组 map 即可</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Maglev 在 BPF 里的落地方式有两种：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 项的 <code>u32</code> 数组装进 <code>BPF_MAP_TYPE_ARRAY</code>（查表时 <code>bpf_map_lookup_elem</code> 一个索引），或在用户态算好后用 <code>BPF_MAP_TYPE_PROG_ARRAY</code>/常量重编。Katran 与 Cilium 都提供 Maglev 作为可选的哈希算法（Cilium 的 <code>--bpf-lb-algorithm</code> 与 Maglev 表大小配置见 <a href=\"https://docs.cilium.io/en/stable/network/kubernetes/kubeproxy-free/\">Cilium 官方文档</a>）。小规模部署用随机哈希加连接表通常够用，Maglev 的收益在后端频繁扩缩容时才会显现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"五元组哈希与-rss-两个哈希不要混用\">五元组哈希与 RSS：两个哈希不要混用</h2><p>均衡器内部的哈希（选后端）和网卡的 RSS 哈希（选 RX 队列）是两件独立的事，混用会踩坑。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RSS 哈希</strong>由网卡硬件用 <strong>Toeplitz</strong> 算法对五元组计算，结果决定包进哪个 RX 队列。它的作用是让同一条流的包恒定落在同一个队列——这是后续所有 per-队列 处理（含 AF_XDP）正确性的前提。</li>\n<li><strong>均衡器哈希</strong>是软件算的，决定包进哪个后端。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两者的坑在<strong>多队列 XDP</strong>：XDP 程序在哪个队列执行，取决于网卡 RSS 把包分到哪个队列。如果均衡器想「按队列分片维护独立连接表」以消除跨核争用，就必须确认同一五元组的包不会因 RSS 配置变化漂移到别的队列。生产做法是固定 RSS 种子（<code>ethtool -X</code> 查/设 indirection table，<code>ethtool -N</code> 设流定向），而不是依赖网卡随机默认值。</p>\n<p>Toeplitz 哈希的输入是五元组加上一个 40 字节的 RSS 密钥 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>，输出取低若干位作队列索引。它不抗攻击者构造——攻击者知道算法就能构造出全部落在同一队列的五元组，这是<strong>哈希碰撞型 DDoS</strong> 的经典手法。缓解手段是定期轮换 RSS 密钥（密钥变化后已有连接会重新分片，所以只在攻击期间或维护窗口做），或对多于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 个队列的流量做软件二次散列。这一点直接决定了下一节的 DDoS 卸载能不能生效：如果攻击流量全被 RSS 压到一个队列，XDP 程序再好也只在单核上跑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-l4-均衡到-ddos-卸载-一条路径上的分流点\">从 L4 均衡到 DDoS 卸载：一条路径上的分流点</h2><p>XDP 均衡器的入口同时是 DDoS 清洗的最佳位置，因为它在内核分配 <code>sk_buff</code> 之前就能丢包，单位包成本最低。一条典型的生产路径按成本从低到高分层：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>硬件/驱动层</strong>：<code>XDP_DROP</code> 丢明显非法的包（畸形以太类型、非法 IP 头长度、碎片异常）。这一步在 XDP 程序最前面，几乎零成本。</li>\n<li><strong>XDP 层特征匹配</strong>：用 IP 黑名单（<code>BPF_MAP_TYPE_LPM_TRIE</code> 做前缀匹配）、SYN 速率限制、源端口/ASN 组合丢包。Cloudflare 的 DDoS 防护架构即公开描述了在 XDP 层做 L3/L4 首轮丢弃的做法（见 Cloudflare 工程博客对 <code>l4drop</code> 的介绍）。</li>\n<li><strong>XDP 层限速</strong>：对每源 IP 或每子网的 pps/字节做令牌桶，超限 <code>XDP_DROP</code>。令牌桶状态放 per-CPU map 避免原子操作争用。</li>\n<li><strong>转发/清洗</strong>：通过特征但需要深度检查的流量，用 <code>XDP_REDIRECT</code> 交给 AF_XDP socket 或 <code>CPUMAP</code>，进入用户态做七层检测。这条交接线的拓扑约束（队列绑定、XSKMAP 守卫、静默丢包）在本 hub 的 <a href=\"../xdp-afxdp-architecture/xdp-afxdp-redirect-topology\">XDP 与 AF_XDP 协同的数据面拓扑</a> 里详述。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>一个重要工程约束：<strong>XDP 程序返回 <code>XDP_DROP</code> 的包不会回 ICMP</strong>。对正常客户端的端口探测或 PMTU 发现，静默丢包会让它反复重试；所以黑名单/限速规则要留白名单出口，或在用户态侧对需要 ICMP 的场景做降级处理。</p>\n<p>另一个常被忽略的成本是<strong>哈希表的内存与并发</strong>。连接表若用普通 <code>BPF_MAP_TYPE_HASH</code>，写入需要加锁，在 SYN flood 下会成为瓶颈；用 <code>LRU_HASH</code> 配合 <code>BPF_F_NO_PREALLOC</code> 可以减少预分配内存，但要接受淘汰语义。表项大小与每秒新建连接数决定了表该开多大——设每秒新建连接为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>、连接平均存活 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 秒，则稳态表项数约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>entries</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{entries}} \\approx R \\times T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">entries</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对流式流量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 很短（秒级），对一个 100 万 pps 新建速率的入口，表可能要开数十万到百万级条目，这部分是必须预留的常驻内存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>XDP L4 均衡器的设计可以归结为四个正交的决策，任何一个配错都会让整体失效：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>转发模型决定能力边界</strong>：DSR 与 IP-in-IP 封装把回包路径从均衡器上彻底摘掉，是达到线速的前提；代理模式则用带宽换灵活性。Katran 是封装转发的公开参考实现。</li>\n<li><strong>哈希算法决定扩缩容代价</strong>：Maglev 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 项查找表把「后端增删重映射」压缩到被增删后端所占的槽位，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 查表且易放进 BPF map。</li>\n<li><strong>RSS 与均衡哈希必须分开治理</strong>：RSS 决定包进哪个核与哪个 XDP 实例，Toeplitz 算法不抗构造，密钥轮换与流定向是 DDoS 场景下的必要配置。</li>\n<li><strong>DDoS 卸载要分层</strong>：驱动层丢弃 → XDP 特征匹配 → XDP 限速 → 重定向到用户态深度清洗，按成本递增排列；同时注意静默丢包对 ICMP 的影响与连接表的内存/并发开销。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    LB[XDP L4 均衡器] --&gt; M{转发模型}&#10;    M --&gt;|DSR| DSR[回包绕过均衡器]&#10;    M --&gt;|IP-in-IP| ENC[封装跨三层]&#10;    LB --&gt; H{选后端算法}&#10;    H --&gt; MAG[Maglev 查找表]&#10;    H --&gt; RND[随机 + 连接表]&#10;    LB --&gt; R{队列与哈希}&#10;    R --&gt; RSS[RSS Toeplitz&lt;br/&gt;密钥轮换]&#10;    LB --&gt; DD{卸载分层}&#10;    DD --&gt; L1[驱动层丢弃]&#10;    DD --&gt; L2[XDP 特征/限速]&#10;    DD --&gt; L3[重定向用户态清洗]\">graph TD\n    LB[XDP L4 均衡器] --&gt; M{转发模型}\n    M --&gt;|DSR| DSR[回包绕过均衡器]\n    M --&gt;|IP-in-IP| ENC[封装跨三层]\n    LB --&gt; H{选后端算法}\n    H --&gt; MAG[Maglev 查找表]\n    H --&gt; RND[随机 + 连接表]\n    LB --&gt; R{队列与哈希}\n    R --&gt; RSS[RSS Toeplitz&lt;br/&gt;密钥轮换]\n    LB --&gt; DD{卸载分层}\n    DD --&gt; L1[驱动层丢弃]\n    DD --&gt; L2[XDP 特征/限速]\n    DD --&gt; L3[重定向用户态清洗]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"XDP 负载均衡与 L4 转发","id":"xdp-负载均衡与-l4-转发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：L4 均衡器的三种转发模型与其代价","id":"核心概念-l4-均衡器的三种转发模型与其代价"},{"level":2,"text":"Maglev 哈希：为什么不能直接用五元组取模","id":"maglev-哈希-为什么不能直接用五元组取模"},{"level":2,"text":"五元组哈希与 RSS：两个哈希不要混用","id":"五元组哈希与-rss-两个哈希不要混用"},{"level":2,"text":"从 L4 均衡到 DDoS 卸载：一条路径上的分流点","id":"从-l4-均衡到-ddos-卸载-一条路径上的分流点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"尾调用流水线与程序生命周期管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/linux-xdp-afxdp-ebpf-fast-datapath/ebpf-packet-processing/tail-call-program-pipeline"},"next":{"title":"XDP DDoS 缓解与速率限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/linux-xdp-afxdp-ebpf-fast-datapath/fast-datapath-patterns/xdp-ddos-mitigation-rate-limit"}}